Z||000051||grgoyl86||04-06-2001||07:47 AM||||I just took a lok at the Forum for the first time in quite a while. Wow! All this talk about Carlisle! I'm getting excited!<BR>I Scanned through the questions, and a lot of them can be answered by going to <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com." TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com.</A>  There is a link to the Carlisle show there. You can find a map, directions, information, even a pdf file registration form. BTW, preregistration deadline is April 20! If you don't get pre-registered by then, it will cost you $20 to get in the gate, besides the $5 for the Fiero show. That's $10 more!<BR>If you can't open the pre-reg form, contact me (info@fieropride.com) ASAP with your postal address, and we'll get one in the mail to you. <BR>Most importantly, hope for good weather!<P>See you all there . . .||||reg||6
